WEBVTT

00:13.170 --> 00:16.980
Now, what do we do with you?

00:21.130 --> 00:22.870
A-Allen...

00:22.870 --> 00:24.280
It's all right.

00:24.280 --> 00:25.790
Just leave it to me.

00:27.040 --> 00:28.000
Hm?

00:31.930 --> 00:34.750
Are you Megath, by any chance?

00:35.520 --> 00:38.750
What's it to you?

00:39.050 --> 00:42.020
Oh! So you really are Megath!

00:42.340 --> 00:44.030
My goodness, it takes me back!

00:44.030 --> 00:46.010
It's been what, seven years?

00:47.520 --> 00:50.120
You cheeky bastard!

00:47.770 --> 00:50.020
<b>IRKED</b>

00:50.120 --> 00:53.030
I don't know a human like you!

00:53.390 --> 00:54.530
Oh...

00:54.530 --> 00:57.040
I guess you have a poor memory.

00:57.320 --> 00:58.500
It's me.

00:58.500 --> 01:02.030
I'm Allen Crawford from 
Athena Magical Academy.

01:02.030 --> 01:03.480
What?!

01:05.660 --> 01:09.700
P-Please excuse my rudeness, I didn't 
realize you were the Great Demon Lord!

01:10.170 --> 01:13.670
<b>TREMBLE    TREMBLE</b>

01:10.170 --> 01:13.670
<b>TREMBLE    TREMBLE</b>

01:10.170 --> 01:13.670
<b>TREMBLE    TREMBLE</b>

01:10.170 --> 01:13.670
<b>TREMBLE    TREMBLE</b>

01:10.170 --> 01:13.670
<b>TREMBLE    TREMBLE</b>

01:10.170 --> 01:13.670
<b>TREMBLE    TREMBLE</b>

01:10.170 --> 01:13.670
<b>TREMBLE    TREMBLE</b>

01:10.170 --> 01:13.670
<b>TREMBLE    TREMBLE</b>

01:10.170 --> 01:13.670
<b>TREMBLE    TREMBLE</b>

01:10.170 --> 01:13.670
<b>TREMBLE    TREMBLE</b>

01:10.180 --> 01:13.300
Please accept my apology!

01:13.300 --> 01:16.670
Please... Please!

01:17.540 --> 01:19.430
Let's see...

01:19.430 --> 01:21.880
Wha... What's wrong with you, boss?!

01:21.880 --> 01:22.990
Exactly!

01:22.990 --> 01:25.930
Boss, you can beat a weakling 
like this in one shot!

01:25.930 --> 01:28.310
You all shut up!

01:28.310 --> 01:30.940
Stop provoking him any further!

01:33.710 --> 01:35.830
What's going on?

01:36.370 --> 01:38.600
So our dad...

01:39.170 --> 01:43.100
He's the chairperson of the biggest 
magical academy in this country.

01:43.100 --> 01:44.440
Eruca?

01:44.730 --> 01:49.170
Bro graduated from that academy at the 
age of 12, the youngest in its history.

01:49.170 --> 01:53.460
And he became a teacher right 
after that, so he's a genius.

01:53.460 --> 01:55.450
What?!?!

01:55.450 --> 01:58.130
P-Please forgive me, Great Demon Lord!

01:58.130 --> 02:01.460
I didn't mean to cause you trouble!

02:01.850 --> 02:03.870
"Great Demon Lord"?

02:03.870 --> 02:06.470
It was his nickname when he was a teacher.

02:06.470 --> 02:08.560
"Great Demon Lord," huh?

02:08.560 --> 02:11.080
I haven't been called by 
that name in a long time.

02:11.530 --> 02:13.730
That takes me back.

02:14.380 --> 02:16.710
Please raise your head, Megath.

02:16.710 --> 02:19.820
You didn't cause any trouble.

02:19.820 --> 02:21.500
Th-Then...

02:22.320 --> 02:25.490
Not to <i>me</i>, at least.

02:27.490 --> 02:31.740
The person your underlings 
tried to hurt is my...

02:32.760 --> 02:33.830
<i>My...?</i>

02:34.310 --> 02:37.400
<i>What is Charlotte to me?</i>

02:40.580 --> 02:42.510
<i>A simple lodger?</i>

02:43.470 --> 02:45.200
<i>A second little sister?</i>

02:47.070 --> 02:48.170
<i>Or...</i>

02:50.380 --> 02:51.430
A woman...

02:54.430 --> 02:57.290
A woman who's precious to me.

03:00.110 --> 03:04.660
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

04:28.330 --> 04:32.790
<b>Naughty Outing</b>

04:28.870 --> 04:30.870
Good morning!

04:30.870 --> 04:32.990
Hey there, Bro!

04:32.990 --> 04:34.960
Uh, what?

04:36.000 --> 04:39.500
<b>GLOOM</b>

04:39.830 --> 04:41.810
Miacha, what is this?

04:41.810 --> 04:44.010
How would I know, nya?

04:44.610 --> 04:46.230
What's the matter, Bro?

04:46.230 --> 04:48.520
Are you all right, Demon Lord?

04:49.570 --> 04:53.770
I didn't know you two had grown so close.

04:53.770 --> 04:56.270
What happened, nya?

04:56.900 --> 04:59.670
Ah... Tell me, Bro.

05:00.250 --> 05:03.280
I know! Something happened 
between you and Charlotte!

05:03.280 --> 05:06.270
Ugh! H-How did you know?

05:06.520 --> 05:08.390
I mean, let me ask you.

05:08.390 --> 05:11.010
Are there other issues that 
can trouble you this much?

05:11.010 --> 05:13.300
Did you two have a fight?

05:15.350 --> 05:17.750
I wish it was that easy...

05:19.810 --> 05:21.400
Wages?

05:21.400 --> 05:23.300
I can't possibly accept that!

05:23.630 --> 05:25.170
What's there to be surprised about?

05:25.170 --> 05:27.010
You've been here for a month.

05:27.010 --> 05:30.540
I told you I'd hire you, so of 
course I'm going to pay you.

05:30.540 --> 05:34.370
But all I'm good at is cleaning,

05:34.370 --> 05:37.800
and I don't feel I'm being 
useful enough to get paid.

05:38.230 --> 05:43.070
On top of cleaning the house, you take 
excellent care of the garden as well.

05:43.690 --> 05:47.810
Ever since you came, it's been nothing 
but pleasant to be in this house.

05:48.240 --> 05:52.250
So, this is fair compensation for your work.

05:53.120 --> 05:56.080
Are you... sure?

05:56.080 --> 05:59.070
Yes, please accept it.

06:00.180 --> 06:01.450
Very well.

06:01.870 --> 06:03.330
I'm grateful.

06:03.740 --> 06:07.850
You could save the money, but 
I recommend spending it.

06:08.130 --> 06:12.260
Don't you have anything you 
want to do or buy?

06:12.260 --> 06:14.300
Not especially...

06:14.900 --> 06:15.840
Oh!

06:17.430 --> 06:20.090
Well, then...

06:20.550 --> 06:22.990
If it's not asking too much...

06:22.990 --> 06:25.980
Sure, go ahead. Tell me.

06:26.820 --> 06:30.330
I'd like to go to town alone.

06:31.920 --> 06:35.240
Sending her to town alone...

06:35.240 --> 06:39.210
That's like throwing marbled 
meat into a cage of beasts!

06:40.300 --> 06:43.000
What am I supposed to do?!

06:43.000 --> 06:47.530
Really? That pancake restaurant 
sucks that bad, huh?

06:47.530 --> 06:50.120
But there's always a long line.

06:50.120 --> 06:52.290
Most of them are fake customers, nya!

06:52.290 --> 06:53.760
Listen to me, you two!

06:54.070 --> 06:57.090
But I didn't expect that from Charlotte.

06:57.090 --> 07:01.760
I thought she'd worry about causing you 
trouble in case people find out who she is.

07:02.240 --> 07:05.770
Right. She withdrew the request right away.

07:06.830 --> 07:12.040
I-I'm sorry, please forget that I asked.

07:14.760 --> 07:16.070
Don't worry!

07:16.070 --> 07:18.920
With my magic, it's a piece of cake!

07:20.950 --> 07:22.910
Thank you so much!

07:22.910 --> 07:24.090
Huh?

07:24.090 --> 07:26.420
So you did say it was okay?

07:26.680 --> 07:31.420
Hearing her sad voice like 
that... How could I say no?!

07:31.420 --> 07:34.430
You've chosen a thorny path, nya.

07:36.700 --> 07:41.910
Even though it's her first 
wish, I'm extremely concerned.

07:42.190 --> 07:44.070
But I mean...

07:44.070 --> 07:48.440
Your problem is easily solved, right?

07:48.440 --> 07:49.680
Yes, nya.

08:00.100 --> 08:02.950
I'm actually really here...

08:03.290 --> 08:06.130
Who knew we could do something like this?

08:06.130 --> 08:09.460
I can't believe you didn't come up with it.

08:09.460 --> 08:10.960
Oh, right.

08:12.200 --> 08:13.720
First, I need to do this.

08:13.960 --> 08:14.850
There we go!

08:14.850 --> 08:16.470
That's right, Charlotte!

08:16.470 --> 08:20.240
You referred to the map, 
just like I taught you!

08:21.550 --> 08:25.740
By the way, why did Charlotte 
want to come to town?

08:27.180 --> 08:29.240
She said she had something to buy.

08:29.690 --> 08:32.350
But you don't know what she wants to buy?

08:32.350 --> 08:34.500
I tried to ask, but...

08:35.140 --> 08:39.240
That's a... s-secret!

08:40.880 --> 08:43.640
She didn't tell you.

08:43.640 --> 08:45.870
That must have been shocking, nya.

08:45.870 --> 08:50.250
She has secrets now, which means 
she's becoming her own person!

08:50.670 --> 08:52.570
Good job, Charlotte!

08:52.570 --> 08:57.350
You should start asserting 
yourself and giving me trouble.

08:57.350 --> 09:01.110
It's beyond creepy, I'm 
getting worried about him.

09:08.400 --> 09:10.670
Doesn't it look like she's having trouble?

09:11.110 --> 09:15.030
Oh... maybe she's lost?

09:15.030 --> 09:18.270
What?! Th-That's a huge problem!

09:21.530 --> 09:24.410
You may not be so far 
off in that assessment.

09:24.410 --> 09:26.920
Huh? What do you mean by that?

09:27.280 --> 09:28.840
If she proceeds straight ahead,

09:28.840 --> 09:33.430
she could end up in the Meard district, 
which isn't a very safe area.

09:33.430 --> 09:34.710
What?!

09:34.710 --> 09:39.430
A party called Serpent Fang controls 
the area leading to Meard,

09:39.430 --> 09:43.650
and its leader is a man named 
Groh, a viper charmer.

09:44.420 --> 09:46.170
What should we do, Bro?

09:46.170 --> 09:49.180
I could pretend that I happened 
to walk by and stop her.

09:50.440 --> 09:51.330
No.

09:51.750 --> 09:54.500
This is Charlotte's first adventure.

09:54.500 --> 09:56.570
I'd rather not throw a wet blanket on it.

09:56.790 --> 09:57.830
But...

09:59.780 --> 10:02.200
I remembered there's something 
I need to take care of.

10:02.200 --> 10:04.450
I'll leave this issue to you.

10:04.450 --> 10:05.450
Huh?!

10:05.450 --> 10:07.210
Where are you going?!

10:07.210 --> 10:09.750
See you later, nya!

10:12.660 --> 10:16.210
She's headed straight to 
where it's not safe, nya.

10:16.210 --> 10:20.440
I wonder what map she's looking at...

10:20.440 --> 10:25.230
If she takes another left turn, 
she'll be in the Meard district, nya.

10:34.270 --> 10:36.610
Where the heck is my Bro?

10:41.490 --> 10:44.110
Where am I...?

10:51.750 --> 10:54.960
Hey, this is <i>really</i> bad!

10:54.960 --> 10:57.970
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

10:57.970 --> 11:00.970
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

11:08.230 --> 11:10.720
We've got no time to waste!

11:10.720 --> 11:12.730
Welcome, ma'am!

11:14.960 --> 11:17.400
Ms. Charlotte, I presume?

11:17.400 --> 11:19.320
My name is Groh.

11:19.320 --> 11:21.770
Thank you for traveling all 
this way to visit this area.

11:21.770 --> 11:23.450
Welcome to our home!

11:23.450 --> 11:24.810
We welcome you!

11:25.110 --> 11:27.620
Huh? Huh? Huh?

11:28.060 --> 11:29.380
What is that?

11:29.380 --> 11:30.490
Who knows?

11:31.120 --> 11:33.530
It's easily explained.

11:34.040 --> 11:36.130
Bro! Where have you been?!

11:36.590 --> 11:39.880
I got here ahead of you 
and taught them a lesson.

11:40.490 --> 11:44.650
I also told them to treat Charlotte 
graciously when she arrived.

11:44.650 --> 11:46.900
You put monster parents to shame, Bro!

11:47.220 --> 11:51.390
Ah, that's why all of them 
are so beaten up, nya.

11:52.510 --> 11:54.890
Are you all right, everyone?

11:54.890 --> 11:55.790
Huh?

11:57.080 --> 12:01.880
Um, well, because it looks 
like you are injured...

12:02.970 --> 12:05.770
This is a magical potion.

12:06.120 --> 12:08.570
Please use it if you'd like.

12:08.570 --> 12:09.800
For your snake, too.

12:12.250 --> 12:14.040
Thank you very much!

12:14.040 --> 12:17.060
Of course, my pleasure.

12:17.460 --> 12:19.550
She's a goddess!

12:19.550 --> 12:23.810
I'm going to change my ways 
and live an honest life!

12:23.810 --> 12:24.980
Me too!

12:24.980 --> 12:25.970
Same here!

12:25.970 --> 12:29.810
O-Oh my gosh, what's gotten into you?

12:30.170 --> 12:32.070
Please raise your heads!

12:32.470 --> 12:34.390
Well, well, Charlotte.

12:34.390 --> 12:37.920
She's quite good at earning 
the trust of others.

12:37.920 --> 12:41.060
It's as if we're reading a passage 
from a mythological story, nya.

12:41.310 --> 12:46.570
By the way, what is your relationship 
with the Great Demon Lord?

12:46.570 --> 12:47.390
Huh?

12:47.840 --> 12:51.090
Are all of you acquaintances of Allen?

12:51.460 --> 12:53.600
We wouldn't call him an "acquaintance"...

12:53.600 --> 12:56.330
Rather, we were forced into...

12:57.000 --> 12:59.300
Tell her and see what happens...

13:00.150 --> 13:01.040
Watch it!

13:02.310 --> 13:05.800
They're under some threat alright.

13:07.410 --> 13:10.050
I've shown them what this can do.

13:10.050 --> 13:11.700
Nya-huh...

13:12.510 --> 13:18.060
My relationship with Allen...?

13:20.570 --> 13:25.560
Well, you see... I don't 
have a home to go back to.

13:25.970 --> 13:31.610
But Allen kindly hired me as an employee.

13:31.610 --> 13:35.590
So for me, Allen is...

13:38.200 --> 13:42.580
M-My master, I guess?

13:44.850 --> 13:48.430
<i>How immoral and debauched it sounds!</i>

13:48.430 --> 13:50.840
Um, Bro? Are you okay?

13:50.840 --> 13:53.720
I'm gonna get heartburn, nya.

13:54.100 --> 13:57.690
Dear goddess, perhaps you 
are being tricked...?

13:57.690 --> 13:59.850
Nah, more like threatened?

14:00.240 --> 14:05.610
You, coupled with the Great Demon 
Lord, screams "crime" to me.

14:05.610 --> 14:07.240
Those guys...!

14:08.020 --> 14:11.360
<i>But I know it as well as they do.</i>

14:12.070 --> 14:15.430
<i>I'm the Great Demon Lord 
even thugs are afraid of,</i>

14:15.430 --> 14:18.500
<i>and she is a goddess who is kind to all...</i>

14:19.100 --> 14:22.560
<i>No matter how you look at it, 
she's too good for me.</i>

14:23.400 --> 14:27.080
But Allen is such a gentleman.

14:27.080 --> 14:28.760
There must be some sort of misunderstanding.

14:29.880 --> 14:31.670
Is that true?

14:31.670 --> 14:34.740
Wouldn't have guessed that 
from the Great Demon Lord.

14:35.640 --> 14:40.890
Plus, Allen teaches me all 
kinds of naughty things.

14:42.700 --> 14:44.390
Naughty things...?!

14:44.660 --> 14:45.510
Huh?

14:45.530 --> 14:47.900
<b>BLANK</b>

14:48.240 --> 14:53.390
Just the other day, Allen and I did 
a naughty thing all night long.

14:53.940 --> 14:58.920
I knew it was improper, 
but it was a fun night.

14:58.920 --> 15:00.370
Bro...

15:00.370 --> 15:01.750
Demon Lord...

15:01.750 --> 15:04.310
We pulled an all-nighter playing 
video games and eating snacks.

15:04.310 --> 15:06.920
But I'll warn her not to 
mention it in public...

15:06.920 --> 15:10.430
Everyone, thank you for your time.

15:10.430 --> 15:12.070
Farewell!

15:11.420 --> 15:13.000
Take care!

15:13.670 --> 15:16.420
Good. So far so good.

15:16.420 --> 15:21.030
But Demon Lord, Lottie's 
gone even further in, nya...

15:21.030 --> 15:26.180
I see. There are a lot more 
dangerous parties ahead...

15:26.570 --> 15:28.690
Nothing to worry about.

15:29.020 --> 15:31.210
Bro, don't tell me...

15:31.210 --> 15:32.170
Right.

15:32.170 --> 15:34.900
It's easily taken care of.

15:36.250 --> 15:40.970
All I have to do is to take 
control of this whole area!

15:42.440 --> 15:44.860
I knew he was an idiot.

