16:25.740 --> 16:28.250
Well, your logic's sound, but...

16:28.250 --> 16:33.250
I bet Charlotte doesn't want you to know 
whatever it is she's going to buy.

16:34.230 --> 16:35.760
But...!

16:35.760 --> 16:40.220
In that case, I will continue 
to watch her on my own, nya!

16:40.220 --> 16:44.780
Now then, please wait until 
her shopping is over, nya!

16:44.780 --> 16:45.900
Nice!

16:45.900 --> 16:47.620
Thanks, Miacha!

16:57.990 --> 17:01.530
You think Charlotte will come back soon...?

17:03.620 --> 17:05.560
Allen, Eruca!

17:06.720 --> 17:10.530
Lottie completed her shopping 
without a hitch, nya.

17:11.080 --> 17:12.550
Good work.

17:12.550 --> 17:15.290
But are you sure she's alright
without you watching her?

17:15.570 --> 17:20.280
Yes. It seems that she came across one of 
her acquaintances, so she's with her, nya.

17:20.280 --> 17:23.300
I think they'll be here soon, nya.

17:23.300 --> 17:27.250
B-By the way, there's something 
I want to ask you.

17:27.250 --> 17:28.430
What is it, nya?

17:28.740 --> 17:31.450
What exactly did she buy?

17:31.870 --> 17:33.070
Bro...

17:33.070 --> 17:36.760
Actually, I didn't see what she bought, nya.

17:36.760 --> 17:39.260
It felt like bad manners, nya.

17:39.260 --> 17:40.230
I see.

17:42.250 --> 17:44.070
Oh, here they come.

17:44.550 --> 17:50.530
Allen, Eruca, Miacha, you all are here.

17:50.530 --> 17:52.200
It's been a while.

17:52.200 --> 17:55.600
Ah, if it isn't the hair
accessories store owner.

17:56.010 --> 17:59.580
I've got to hand it to you, sir.

18:00.160 --> 18:03.090
What... do you mean?

18:03.390 --> 18:08.360
As we were walking down the street, 
everyone was talking about you, Allen.

18:08.660 --> 18:12.020
About how the Great Demon 
Lord made the streets safe.

18:12.980 --> 18:14.040
How so?

18:14.580 --> 18:15.650
How so?!

18:15.650 --> 18:19.980
Because those roughneck adventurers 
were causing trouble for the townsfolk.

18:19.980 --> 18:25.870
Then you came and straightened up those 
guys, so we're all in your debt.

18:25.870 --> 18:28.700
Wow, that's cool, Bro.

18:28.700 --> 18:31.370
You helped people without meaning to.

18:32.870 --> 18:34.320
That's right.

18:34.320 --> 18:37.400
On behalf of this town, we appreciate it.

18:37.950 --> 18:39.390
Thank you so much.

18:41.620 --> 18:44.480
<i>I simply did it for Charlotte.</i>

18:44.480 --> 18:48.150
<i>Who would have guessed I'd 
be thanked by others?</i>

18:48.600 --> 18:50.180
<i>Life is a strange thing.</i>

18:51.770 --> 18:54.900
No, please don't worry about it.

18:54.900 --> 18:57.660
My motivation was something personal...

18:58.740 --> 19:00.550
We don't see a guy like you every day.

19:00.550 --> 19:03.370
Sweetheart, you got lucky with 
your choice of a boyfriend.

19:03.370 --> 19:04.150
Huh?

19:04.550 --> 19:05.800
Um...

19:06.120 --> 19:08.280
Oh, we're not...

19:09.650 --> 19:11.740
Oh, I see how it is.

19:11.740 --> 19:13.280
Well, good luck.

19:13.630 --> 19:16.560
If you'll excuse me, I should get going.

19:16.560 --> 19:19.850
Yes. Thank you for accompanying me.

19:26.050 --> 19:27.770
B-By the way...

19:28.690 --> 19:32.200
Well, the thing is...

19:32.570 --> 19:33.460
Yes?

19:35.390 --> 19:38.130
How was... your shopping?

19:38.440 --> 19:40.450
It went perfectly!

19:43.940 --> 19:47.700
Oh! Aren't those from that new store?

19:47.700 --> 19:50.450
The coolest spot in town, nya.

19:50.890 --> 19:54.950
Th-These are gifts for 
Eruca and Miacha from me!

19:54.950 --> 19:55.780
Huh?!

19:55.780 --> 19:56.660
Nya?!

19:57.780 --> 19:59.970
Wh-What...?!

20:00.340 --> 20:05.050
You came to town today 
to buy a gift for us?!

20:05.050 --> 20:07.530
I heard it was your first paycheck.

20:07.530 --> 20:09.970
Are you sure I can have it?

20:09.970 --> 20:14.470
Y-Yes. You two have always 
been good to me, so...

20:14.470 --> 20:17.990
Wow! A really cool stuffed kitty!

20:17.990 --> 20:20.830
I got a new hat, nya!

20:20.830 --> 20:22.490
Thank you so much, nya!

20:23.490 --> 20:24.980
I'm glad you like it.

20:25.830 --> 20:26.990
Charlotte!

20:26.990 --> 20:28.000
Yes?

20:29.450 --> 20:31.680
Don't you have... something for me?

20:32.360 --> 20:33.750
Bro...

20:33.750 --> 20:35.050
Demon Lord...

20:37.790 --> 20:42.870
I looked and looked for 
something that'd make you happy.

20:43.490 --> 20:47.160
But I had no idea what you would like...

20:47.500 --> 20:54.310
If it was from you, I'd have been happy 
with a stamp, postcard, flag, train photo,


20:54.310 --> 20:57.760
or even a flower from the side of 
the road, a pebble, an earthworm,

20:57.760 --> 20:59.900
a mole cricket, water strider, 
<i>anything</i> would have made me happy!

21:00.220 --> 21:02.190
I-I'm sorry!

21:02.190 --> 21:05.410
I didn't think it through, even 
though I'm in your debt.

21:05.410 --> 21:09.410
Oh, n-no, I don't mean to blame you...

21:10.270 --> 21:14.910
I've always been on the receiving 
end of your good will,

21:14.910 --> 21:17.490
and I realized I didn't know 
what you liked at all.

21:19.490 --> 21:21.670
So to start, I thought...

21:23.730 --> 21:25.440
Your robe.

21:25.920 --> 21:28.430
Here, the hem is a little frayed...

21:29.170 --> 21:30.180
True.

21:30.670 --> 21:33.550
May I please mend it?

21:34.110 --> 21:39.690
And while I'm at it, please 
tell me everything you like.

21:40.190 --> 21:43.330
So that I can pick a gift for you next time.

21:44.050 --> 21:46.010
O-Of course.

21:47.360 --> 21:50.730
<i>There's a feeling growing in my heart.</i>

21:51.360 --> 21:57.530
<i>The time we spend together will be more 
valuable to me than anything else.</i>

23:30.440 --> 23:33.330
Allen, what kind of story is coming up next?

23:33.330 --> 23:35.820
Next up is a naughty hot spring trip!

23:33.720 --> 23:39.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:33.720 --> 23:39.970
<b>Naughty Hot Spring Trip</b>

23:35.820 --> 23:37.570
A hot spring trip?!

23:37.570 --> 23:38.970
Charlotte?! Are you all right?!
